# Reader pack

ESLint `sonarjs/*` reader rules run on product layers (`app`, `features`, `ui`, `domain`, `theme`, `lib`, `i18n`, `proxy.ts`). The allowlist and threshold live in `eslint.config.js`.

When one fires, extract or rewrite until a person can follow the control flow. A split that only moves the same branching into `foo1` / `foo2` is not done.

Stories, tests, and mocks are out of scope. Do not add the pack there.

`eslint-disable` on these rules is not a fix.
